    "Six site means, four parent bays, one year. Peak reproductive shoot density date is NOT first flowering or seed release date. Lag is an observation-window proxy only.",
    "Potential density is a rounded product of peak stock and fertilized pistils, not annual measured release flux. Bank is separate sampled stock including imports or older seeds. Bank/potential ratio is not individual seed retention or survival; PH1 >100% documented by original authors.",
